Z||000005||gomobile||09-07-2001||07:09 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by operator64:<BR><B>   I'm so excited i closed the deal on my next Fiero. It's an 86 GT 5 speed 112,000 miles. Interior is in excellent condition, paint has a little fading on the hood and the drivers' side sail has a small crack in it. All in all i got an excellent deal for $900.00 and he is delivering it to me from Austin,Tx today. I should have it about 5 or so this evening. Just had to share the excitement .<BR>    Operator64</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>NOT a bad deal!! I brought mine from a friend for 800.00 (also an 1985 GT / AUTO) but guess what I have had it for 2 years and to this day NO problems. If you keep it up it will NOT die on you (I say that cause I am happy with mine). GOOD LUCK with it. <BR>||||reg||6
